---
// src/components/partners/AgencyNDAProtocol.astro
---
<section class="py-20 bg-white border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary mb-4">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path></svg>
          Agency Brand Protection Guarantee
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight">
          How We Protect Your Client Relationships & Agency Brand
        </h3>
        <p class="text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          When you partner with TheEduAssist, your clients remain exclusively your clients. We operate as your invisible technical backbone under strict, legally binding white-label agreements.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <span class="p-1 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-xs">&check;</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-brand-navy font-bold block mb-1">Strict Bilateral Non-Disclosure & Non-Compete:</strong>
              We sign mutual NDAs before reviewing any client project briefs. We will never solicit, directly contact, or service your agency's clients.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <span class="p-1 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-xs">&check;</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-brand-navy font-bold block mb-1">Zero Public Portfolio Claims:</strong>
              Your client work is never published in our public case studies, marketing materials, or social media without your explicit, written consent.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <span class="p-1 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-xs">&check;</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-brand-navy font-bold block mb-1">White-Label Communications & Tooling:</strong>
              We can work directly within your Slack, ClickUp, Asana, Monday, or Google Workspace using your agency domain email if needed.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Graphical Box: Delivery Protocol Workflow -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-brand-navy p-8 md:p-10 rounded-3xl text-white shadow-xl border border-slate-700/60 relative">
        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-secondary animate-pulse"></span>
          Standard White-Label Delivery Flow
        </h4>

        <div class="space-y-6 relative before:absolute before:left-3.5 before:top-3 before:bottom-3 before:w-0.5 before:bg-white/20">
          <!-- Step 1 -->
          <div class="relative pl-10">
            <span class="absolute left-1.5 top-1 -translate-x-1/2 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-secondary text-brand-navy text-[11px] font-black flex items-center justify-center ring-4 ring-slate-900">1</span>
            <h5 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">NDA & Scoping Review</h5>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              We execute our bilateral NDA and review your client's brief or RFP within 24 hours to provide a fixed wholesale quote.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 2 -->
          <div class="relative pl-10">
            <span class="absolute left-1.5 top-1 -translate-x-1/2 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-secondary text-brand-navy text-[11px] font-black flex items-center justify-center ring-4 ring-slate-900">2</span>
            <h5 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Silent Architecture & Sprint Execution</h5>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Our instructional designers and engineers build the modules, portal, or migration in staging environments with regular milestone previews.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 3 -->
          <div class="relative pl-10">
            <span class="absolute left-1.5 top-1 -translate-x-1/2 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-secondary text-brand-navy text-[11px] font-black flex items-center justify-center ring-4 ring-slate-900">3</span>
            <h5 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">3-Tier QA & Zero-Rework Delivery</h5>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              We perform rigorous cross-browser, responsive, and WCAG accessibility testing, packaging the finished deliverables for your agency to present.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 4 -->
          <div class="relative pl-10">
            <span class="absolute left-1.5 top-1 -translate-x-1/2 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-secondary text-brand-navy text-[11px] font-black flex items-center justify-center ring-4 ring-slate-900">4</span>
            <h5 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">You Invoice Your Client with 40–60% Margin</h5>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              You deliver a world-class course or Kajabi platform to your client under your agency's name, retaining the long-term retainer and client relationship.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
